    <briefdescription>
<para>A context that describes measurement variables. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Contains an Axes of MeasurementContext for independent variables (sweep parameters), a list of MeasurementContext for dependent variables (measured parameters), and a unit for interpreting the values. </para>
